# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P15, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
press SEL
tapkey w15
release SEL
tapkey w6
tap PLAY
wait 2500
page 1
turn K1 12 60
turn K3 12 60
wait 1500
tap FX
expect view 13
turn K1 15 40
turn K2 25 40
wait 1500
wav shimmer.wav
# @ P15 Falling with both drones an octave up (G4 and E5), its echoes up
wait 1500
tap FX
expect view 14
# @ The reverb's Type to Shimmer, Into Echoes (with SEL): over 8 seconds the echoes rise an octave into a halo
turn K4 2 300
press SEL
turn K4 1 300
release SEL
expect par64 4
expect par99 1
tap FX
turn K4 25 40
wait 9000
shot shimmer-0.png
tap FX
wait 400
shot shimmer-1.png
wait 3000
wavstop
